{
  "bookId": "activity-snippets-zhounianqingqiandao",
  "id": "section-22404",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称；|102|＝按玩家性别变化的称谓。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "22404001",
          "sourceType": 10,
          "text": "「龙王的祝辞」",
          "title": "小节引文",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22404002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "「喂，人类」……咳咳，「嗨，吾的专属人类」……「好久不见阿，人类」……不行不行……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22404003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿斯塔罗斯",
          "text": "喂，我说，这已经是第678次NG了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22404004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "住口！为了柯斯顿城的门面，身为柯斯顿的一家之主，吾必须展现出最高贵完美的一面。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22404005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿斯塔罗斯",
          "text": "少用那些烂借口，幼稚的家伙，明明就是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22404006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "嗨，「|101|」，现在你看到的是由桑尼带来的特别直播，标题就叫做——「龙王的祝辞」~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22404007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "喂喂喂，快拿开……已、已经开始了吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22404008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "来不及了噢，已经接通了耶，|101||102|现在正在看着你呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22404009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "咳咳……|101|……你、你好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "22404011",
              "text": "你好呀~"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "22404010",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22404011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "好久不见……你、你最近过得好吗！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "22404013",
              "text": "很好，家主大人呢？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "22404012",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22404013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "我也……哎哎哎，咳咳，我今天，咳咳——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22404014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "咳，今日，是吾来到现世的一周年。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22404015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "也马上就是，吾与你相识的一周年。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22404016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "虽然你只是个也没什么了不起的普通人类，不过……莫名的可靠和让人心安。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22404017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "非常感谢你为柯斯顿城和手办世界所做的一切，另外还有……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22404018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿斯塔罗斯",
          "text": "啰里吧嗦，今天就到此为止！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22404019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "喂，阿斯塔罗斯！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22404020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿斯塔罗斯",
          "text": "——就是这样，不赖的家伙，再会！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
